            <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-2">Maicon da Silva Evangelista</h1>
            <p class="text-xl text-slate-300">Senior Cloud Architect | DevOps & SRE | Tech Lead</p>
            <nav class="mt-6" aria-label="Redes sociais e contato">
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
                    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/maiconsi/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 font-medium transition-colors" aria-label="LinkedIn de Maicon (abre em nova aba)">LinkedIn</a>
                    <a href="https://github.com/maiconsi" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 font-medium transition-colors" aria-label="GitHub de Maicon (abre em nova aba)">GitHub</a>
                    <a href="mailto:maiconsi@hotmail.com" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 font-medium transition-colors">Contato</a>
